@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@email = gardener@example.com
@password = correct-horse-battery-staple
@firebaseIdToken = paste-firebase-id-token
@refreshToken = paste-refresh-token
@plantId = paste-plant-id
@deviceToken = paste-device-token
@claimCode = paste-claim-code

# Protected user endpoints require a Firebase ID Token. The legacy auth endpoints
# remain temporarily available until Step 6, but their access token is not accepted
# by protected routes.
# FIREBASE_AUTO_PROVISION_USERS defaults to true because the project has no
# pre-existing users. The first valid Firebase token creates an internal user.

### Liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Legacy register (temporary; returned access token is not accepted by protected routes)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{email}}","password":"{{password}}"}

### Legacy login (temporary; scheduled for removal in Step 6)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{email}}","password":"{{password}}"}

### Rotate refresh token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{"refreshToken":"{{refreshToken}}"}

### Create plant
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/plants
Authorization: Bearer {{firebaseIdToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Monstera","species":"Monstera deliciosa"}

### Claim provisioned device
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/claim
Authorization: Bearer {{firebaseIdToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"claimCode":"{{claimCode}}","plantId":"{{plantId}}"}

### Upload telemetry (device identity comes only from the token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/device/v1/measurements
Authorization: Device {{deviceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"sequence":1,"firmwareVersion":"1.0.0","soilMoistureRaw":1530,"airTemperatureCelsius":23.5,"airHumidityPercent":51.0,"lightRaw":840}

### Latest plant state
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/plants/{{plantId}}/latest
Authorization: Bearer {{firebaseIdToken}}

### Hourly history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/plants/{{plantId}}/history?interval=1h
Authorization: Bearer {{firebaseIdToken}}

### Alert rules
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/plants/{{plantId}}/alert-rules
Authorization: Bearer {{firebaseIdToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"rules":[{"type":"LOW_SOIL_MOISTURE","threshold":25.0,"requiredDurationSeconds":300,"recoveryDurationSeconds":300,"enabled":true}]}
